// These are race-based NPC messages, said by dumb female NPC's to male PC's
// based on the PC's race

// Insult messages start at 1000.

{1000}{Ihr dummig un' garstig!}



// Initial bad greeting messages start at 2000. 

{2000}{Was Ihr willen?!}



// Initial worst greeting messages start at 3000.

{3000}{Ich nich' willen reden mi' Euch.}


// Second bad greeting messages start at 4000. 

{4000}{Warum Ihr wieda hier? Ich nich' magen Euch!}



// Second worst greeting messages start at 5000. 

{5000}{Ich imma noch nich' willen reden mi' Euch!}



// Shrink spell messages start at 6000. 

{6000}{Warum Ihr so kleinig?}

